<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 517 0 R/E(Why Rome? Why EUR? This section examines the strategic choice of location. The Rationalist architecture of the EUR district provides a high-contrast, "theatrical" backdrop that enhances the vintage lines of the cars. It\220s a study on how geographic identity and urban aesthetics can amplify the impact of digital storytelling.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

645 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 517 0 R/E(Community building is the core of this project. The "Meet & Breakfast" format serves as the tangible evolution of the digital feed. It\220s an analysis of how a recurring physical ritual creates brand loyalty, transforming passive scrolling into an active, high-engagement social ecosystem where the community becomes the protagonist.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

